        <mxCell id="error-note" value="The controller maps the use case failure codes: FILE_NOT_FOUND -> 404; FILE_NOT_AVAILABLE or STORAGE_INTEGRITY_MISMATCH -> 409; other download/storage failures -> 500. An unauthenticated request is rejected by Spring Security with 401 before the controller." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef2f2;strokeColor=#dc2626;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7f1d1d;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1510" width="1570" height="58" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
